#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<pthread_self>()  function returns the ID of the calling thread.  This "
"is the same value that is returned in I<*thread> in the "
"B<pthread_create>(3)  call that created this thread."
msgstr ""
"La fonction B<pthread_self>() renvoie l'identifiant du thread appelant. "
"C'est la même valeur qui est renvoyée dans I<*thread> dans l'appel à "
"B<pthread_create>(3)  qui a créé ce thread."

